    <h1>The Ballad of Many Bills</h1>

    <div class="intro">
        <p>A collection of twenty-five humorous verses about a man named <strong>Bill</strong>.<br>
        Includes references to an economist and a fellow named Jurgen.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="limerick-container" id="limericks-list">
